    .{ .slug = "stream", .title = "getUserMedia/Stream API", .search = "getUserMedia/Stream API stream camera,device,getUserMedia,media stream,mediastream,Media Capture API", .description = "Method of accessing external device data (such as a webcam video stream). Formerly this was envisioned as the element.", .notes = "As of Chrome 47, the getUserMedia API cannot be called from insecure origins.", .summary = .{ "154 Full", "156 Full", "27 Full", "152 Full" }, .details = .{ "Version history: 4–20: No; 21–52: Partial (prefix required, #1, #2); 53–154: Full.\n#1: Blink-based (and some other) browsers support an older version of the spec that does not use srcObject. See Chromium issue 387740.\n#2: Supports the older spec's navigator.getUserMedia API, not the newer navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia one.", "Version history: 2–16: No; 17–35: Partial (prefix required, #1, #2); 36–41: Full (#1); 42–156: Full.\n#1: Blink-based (and some other) browsers support an older version of the spec that does not use srcObject. See Chromium issue 387740.\n#2: Supports the older spec's navigator.getUserMedia API, not the newer navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia one.", "Version history: 3.1–10.1: No; 11–27: Full.", "Version history: 12–152: Full." } },
