    .{ .slug = "xhr2", .title = "XMLHttpRequest advanced features", .search = "XMLHttpRequest advanced features xhr2 xhr level 2", .description = "Updated functionality to the original XHR specification including things like file uploads, transfer progress information and the ability to send FormData. Previously known as XMLHttpRequest Level 2, these features now appear simply in the XMLHttpRequest spec.", .notes = "See also support for the FormData API and its sub-features, which received more updates since the original XHR Level 2 specification was released.", .summary = .{ "154 Full", "156 Full", "27 Full", "152 Full" }, .details = .{ "Version history: 4–6: Unknown; 7–28: Partial (#1, #2, #4); 29–30: Partial (#1, #4); 31–49: Partial (#4); 50–154: Full.\n#1: Partial support refers to not supporting json as responseType\n#2: Partial support refers to not supporting .timeout and .ontimeout\n#4: Partial support refers to missing some newer FormData functionality (search for specific APIs for details).", "Version history: 2–3: No; 3.5–5: Partial (#1, #2, #3, #4); 6–9: Partial (#1, #2, #4); 10–11: Partial (#2, #4); 12–46: Partial (#4); 47–156: Full.\n#1: Partial support refers to not supporting json as responseType\n#2: Partial support refers to not supporting .timeout and .ontimeout\n#3: Partial support refers to not supporting blob as responseType\n#4: Partial support refers to missing some newer FormData functionality (search for specific APIs for details).", "Version history: 3.1–4: No; 5–6: Partial (#1, #2, #4); 6.1–7: Partial (#1, #4); 7.1–11: Partial (#4); 11.1–27: Full.\n#1: Partial support refers to not supporting json as responseType\n#2: Partial support refers to not supporting .timeout and .ontimeout\n#4: Partial support refers to missing some newer FormData functionality (search for specific APIs for details).", "Version history: 12–18: Partial (#4); 79–152: Full.\n#4: Partial support refers to missing some newer FormData functionality (search for specific